# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-08-03 11:17

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:26
translate italian lisa12_de418d13:

    # "I almost bump into Lisa as she is coming out of the kitchen in her nightgown."
    "Per poco non mi scontri con Lisa mentre esce dalla cucina in camicia da notte."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:27
translate italian lisa12_8c32ad84:

    # sp "Oh hey, [pcname]. I wanted to talk to you."
    sp "Oh ehi, [pcname]. Volevo parlarti."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:28
translate italian lisa12_2aeaa14a:

    # sp "Would you want to come with me to Whiterock for the weekend?"
    sp "Ti andrebbe di venire con me a Whiterock per il fine settimana?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:29
translate italian lisa12_032107bb:

    # sp "I have a work meeting. On a Saturday, can you believe that?"
    sp "Ho una riunione di lavoro. Di sabato, ci credi?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:31
translate italian lisa12_39291e8d:

    # sp "Anyways, I really didn't want to go alone, and Suzy has to work."
    sp "Comunque, non volevo proprio andarci da solo, e Suzy deve lavorare."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:32
translate italian lisa12_5916292c:

    # sp "So do you want to come?"
    sp "Allora, vuoi venire?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:37
translate italian lisa12_056fc622:

    # "Are you sure? This could be the opportunity to repair things with Lisa, and maybe move things forward."
    "Sei sicuro? Potrebbe essere l’occasione giusta per sistemare le cose con Lisa e magari fare un passo avanti."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:43
translate italian lisa12_b94ddecf:

    # sp "Oh, okay then. I'll talk to you later, [pcname]."
    sp "Oh, va bene allora. Ci sentiamo più tardi, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:44
translate italian lisa12_ac712811:

    # "Lisa leaves and goes to her bedroom and I walk up to my room."
    "Lisa se ne va e va in camera sua, mentre io salgo nella mia stanza."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:50
translate italian lisa12_79ef6461:

    # sp "Great! It should be fun. Just be ready to go Saturday morning."
    sp "Fantastico! Dovrebbe essere divertente. Preparati per partire sabato mattina."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:51
translate italian lisa12_9ff43948:

    # pc "Okay, [mom], I will."
    pc "Ok, [mom], lo farò."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:53
translate italian lisa12_035df041:

    # "Lisa leaves and goes to her bedroom and I walk upstairs to my room."
    "Lisa se ne va e va in camera sua, mentre io salgo al piano di sopra nella mia stanza."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:76
translate italian lisa12b_915d791d:

    # "It's Saturday morning, so I get up a little early and get ready to go to Whiterock with Lisa for the weekend."
    "È sabato mattina, quindi mi alzo un po’ prima e mi preparo per andare a Whiterock con Lisa per il fine settimana."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:80
translate italian lisa12b_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/lisa_goodmorning.wav'
    voice 'voices/lisa_goodmorning.wav'

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:81
translate italian lisa12b_956a7d40:

    # sp "Good morning, [pcname]. I thought I might have to go up there and wake you up."
    sp "Buongiorno, [pcname]. Pensavo che avrei dovuto salire lassù a svegliarti."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:82
translate italian lisa12b_9d77e332:

    # sp "I'm so glad you're coming with me. It's such a boring trip by myself."
    sp "Sono così felice che tu venga con me. Da sola è un viaggio così noioso."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:83
translate italian lisa12b_5d39a375:

    # pc "I'm excited to get to spend some time with you and check out Whiterock. I haven't been there in forever."
    pc "Non vedo l’ora di passare un po’ di tempo con te e di dare un’occhiata a Whiterock. Non ci vado da una vita."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:84
translate italian lisa12b_c34f709b:

    # sp "You ready to go?"
    sp "Sei pronta a partire?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:85
translate italian lisa12b_f420071e:

    # pc "Yeah, let's do this."
    pc "Sì, andiamo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:88
translate italian lisa12b_20b6c345:

    # "We put our bags in the trunk then get in her car and she starts driving down the highway towards Whiterock."
    "Mettiamo le valigie nel bagagliaio, poi saliamo sulla sua auto e lei inizia a guidare lungo l’autostrada verso Whiterock."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:89
translate italian lisa12b_ba052259:

    # sp "So, when we get there, I'm going to have to go right to the meetings."
    sp "Allora, quando arriveremo lì, dovrò andare subito alle riunioni."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:90
translate italian lisa12b_07f5dc42:

    # sp "You can take my car and either go to the hotel room and hang out there, or find something to do around town until I'm done sometime in the late afternoon."
    sp "Puoi prendere la mia auto e andare in camera d’albergo a rilassarti, oppure trovare qualcosa da fare in città finché non avrò finito, verso il tardo pomeriggio."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:91
translate italian lisa12b_fa082b68:

    # pc "Okay, [mom]. That sounds fine."
    pc "Ok, [mom]. Mi sembra perfetto."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:92
translate italian lisa12b_44d1a03a:

    # sp "Then in the evening, we can do something fun. Get something to eat, see a movie, something like that?"
    sp "Poi la sera possiamo fare qualcosa di divertente. Andare a mangiare qualcosa, vedere un film, qualcosa del genere?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:93
translate italian lisa12b_a49fe0e0:

    # sp "Then tomorrow, maybe we could see a few sites around Whiterock."
    sp "E domani, magari potremmo visitare qualche posto nei dintorni di Whiterock."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:94
translate italian lisa12b_1c72385a:

    # pc "Sure. That sounds great."
    pc "Certo. Mi sembra fantastico."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:97
translate italian lisa12b_bd67c1c4:

    # "Suddenly she reaches over to the radio and turns the volume up."
    "All’improvviso allunga la mano verso la radio e alza il volume."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:99
translate italian lisa12b_231144c9:

    # sp "Oh, I love this song!"
    sp "Oh, adoro questa canzone!"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:100
translate italian lisa12b_7021c611:

    # "She starts moving her hips and shoulders to it while she drives, singing the lyrics under her breath."
    "Comincia a muovere i fianchi e le spalle a ritmo mentre guida, canticchiando il testo sottovoce."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:105
translate italian lisa12b_1c5020d5:

    # "I don't really know the song very well, but I hesitantly start singing along."
    "Non conosco molto bene la canzone, ma esitante comincio a cantare con lei."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:106
translate italian lisa12b_3cb48af8:

    # "As soon as I start, she raises her voice, singing louder, belting out the lyrics and smiling."
    "Non appena inizio, lei alza la voce, cantando più forte, intonando il testo a squarciagola e sorridendo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:107
translate italian lisa12b_66d20525:

    # "Her singing voice is actually really good. I'd never heard her sing like this. I'm not sure I'd ever seen her this happy."
    "In realtà canta davvero bene. Non l’avevo mai sentita cantare così. Non sono sicuro di averla mai vista così felice."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:110
translate italian lisa12b_f0fabc83:

    # "When the song is over, she looks at me with a loving smile."
    "Quando la canzone finisce, mi guarda con un sorriso affettuoso."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:111
translate italian lisa12b_5f255ff8:

    # sp "That was fun."
    sp "È stato divertente."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:112
translate italian lisa12b_f29fffdc:

    # sp "This is going to be a fun weekend."
    sp "Questo sarà un weekend divertente."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:116
translate italian lisa12b_c8985f78:

    # "I look away, embarrassed."
    "Distolgo lo sguardo, imbarazzato."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:117
translate italian lisa12b_e4f45d25:

    # pc "Geez, [mom]. So cringe."
    pc "Cavolo, [mom]. Che imbarazzo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:118
translate italian lisa12b_6f576d87:

    # sp "Aw, you're no fun."
    sp "Oh, non sei divertente."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:121
translate italian lisa12b_013869be:

    # "When we get to Whiterock, I can't help but be a little bit impressed."
    "Quando arriviamo a Whiterock, non posso fare a meno di rimanere un po’ impressionato."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:122
translate italian lisa12b_fe15f26e:

    # "It's not like it's the first big city I've been to or anything, but growing up in Skyhill, where the tallest building might be three stories, it's always a little overwhelming to be surrounded by these huge buildings and all the people walking the streets."
    "Non è che sia la prima grande città in cui mi trovo o cose del genere, ma essendo cresciuto a Skyhill, dove l’edificio più alto arriva forse a tre piani, è sempre un po’ travolgente trovarsi circondato da questi edifici enormi e da tutta quella gente che cammina per le strade."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:123
translate italian lisa12b_e1fdc4ca:

    # sp "I still get that way too."
    sp "Mi capita ancora di sentirmi così."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:124
translate italian lisa12b_16b58502:

    # pc "What way?"
    pc "In che senso?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:125
translate italian lisa12b_892bc987:

    # sp "Overwhelmed by the city."
    sp "Travolto dalla città."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:126
translate italian lisa12b_8eb11c15:

    # pc "How did you know what I was thinking?"
    pc "Come facevi a sapere cosa stavo pensando?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:127
translate italian lisa12b_8dcb5ae2:

    # sp "I can see your face. You don't really hide your emotions well."
    sp "Riesco a vederti in faccia. Non riesci proprio a nascondere bene le tue emozioni."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:128
translate italian lisa12b_f250bb46:

    # sp "Anyway, I grew up here in Whiterock, but I've gotten so used to small town living in Skyhill that it always makes me anxious to come back here."
    sp "Comunque, sono cresciuta qui a Whiterock, ma mi sono abituata così tanto alla vita di provincia a Skyhill che tornare qui mi rende sempre ansiosa."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:131
translate italian lisa12b_7787c8df:

    # "When we get to the building where her meeting is, she parks the car and we get out to switch seats."
    "Quando arriviamo all’edificio dove si terrà la sua riunione, lei parcheggia l’auto e scendiamo per scambiarci i posti."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:132
translate italian lisa12b_1d71f7ca:

    # sp "Be careful and I'll just call you when I'm ready to get picked up, okay?"
    sp "Stai attenta e ti chiamerò quando sarò pronta per farmi venire a prendere, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:133
translate italian lisa12b_02f02bb1:

    # pc "Okay, [mom]. I'm not sure what I'm going to do for the next few hours."
    pc "Ok, [mom]. Non so bene cosa farò nelle prossime ore."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:134
translate italian lisa12b_2a51c017:

    # sp "Maybe get some coffee? Or go to the park? Or the library?"
    sp "Magari prendo un caffè? Oppure vado al parco? O in biblioteca?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:135
translate italian lisa12b_08191e56:

    # pc "I do have some homework that I need to do. I'll figure out something."
    pc "Ho dei compiti da sbrigare. Mi verrà in mente qualcosa."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:136
translate italian lisa12b_2a1de65c:

    # sp "Okay honey, have fun. I'll see you later."
    sp "Ok tesoro, divertiti. Ci vediamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:137
translate italian lisa12b_471793bd:

    # pc "Okay. Bye, [mom]."
    pc "Ok. Ciao, [mom]."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:140
translate italian lisa12b_51472cb9:

    # "She goes inside and I try to decide where I should go."
    "Lei entra e io cerco di decidere dove andare."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:147
translate italian lisa12b_7bd1548b:

    # "I decide to go get some coffee and try to get some homework done in a local cafe."
    "Decido di andare a prendere un caffè e di provare a sbrigare un po’ di compiti in un bar del posto."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:148
translate italian lisa12b_ee16aa89:

    # "The coffee is okay. Not as good as Java Lava, but it's not bad."
    "Il caffè è discreto. Non buono come quello di Java Lava, ma non è male."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:149
translate italian lisa12b_de9d8e32:

    # "The place is quiet and not very crowded, so I sit and focus on my homework."
    "Il locale è tranquillo e non molto affollato, quindi mi siedo e mi concentro sui compiti."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:150
translate italian lisa12b_517173c8:

    # "I get most of it done over the next couple of hours."
    "Ne sbrigo la maggior parte nelle due ore successive."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:151
translate italian lisa12b_dc51d393:

    # "People come and go, and I get a refill on my coffee once."
    "La gente va e viene, e io mi faccio riempire la tazza di caffè una volta."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:152
translate italian lisa12b_2d9aed35:

    # "Then, as I'm working, I sort of get goosebumps as I feel somebody's eyes on me."
    "Poi, mentre sto lavorando, mi viene quasi la pelle d’oca perché sento lo sguardo di qualcuno su di me."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:155
translate italian lisa12b_e3e3b995:

    # "I look up and see a girl sitting across the room, looking at me."
    "Alzo lo sguardo e vedo una ragazza seduta dall’altra parte della sala che mi sta guardando."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:156
translate italian lisa12b_05662d61:

    # "She's cute - short blonde hair, piercing blue eyes, and very petite."
    "È carina: capelli biondi corti, occhi blu penetranti ed è molto minuta."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:157
translate italian lisa12b_925ce215:

    # "And she's staring at me like she's looking through me. Like she's trying to figure out something about me."
    "E mi sta fissando come se volesse guardarmi dentro. Come se stesse cercando di capire qualcosa di me."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:158
translate italian lisa12b_1bdbba16:

    # "It takes her a moment to realize that I've caught her staring, but when she does, she looks away."
    "Le ci vuole un attimo per rendersi conto che l’ho sorpresa a fissarmi, ma quando se ne accorge, distoglie lo sguardo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:159
translate italian lisa12b_b5be796a:

    # "Maybe I should go talk to her?"
    "Forse dovrei andare a parlarle?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:164
translate italian lisa12b_525e7f65:

    # "I stand up and walk over towards her. She turns away and looks a bit startled that I'm approaching her."
    "Mi alzo e mi avvicino a lei. Si gira dall’altra parte e sembra un po’ sorpresa che mi stia avvicinando."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:165
translate italian lisa12b_c5a269fe:

    # pc "Hey there. My name is [pcname]. I just saw you looking over and thought you might want to talk or something?"
    pc "Ehi. Mi chiamo [pcname]. Ti ho appena vista guardarmi e ho pensato che forse avresti voluto parlare o qualcosa del genere?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:168
translate italian lisa12b_37b4f43d:

    # "She quickly jumps up, leaving her coffee behind, and rushes towards the door."
    "Si alza di scatto, lasciando lì il suo caffè, e si precipita verso la porta."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:169
translate italian lisa12b_aa5435db:

    # "Cute Woman" "Sorry. Can't talk. Gotta go!"
    "Cute Woman" "Scusa. Non posso parlare. Devo andare!"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:172
translate italian lisa12b_f05dac62:

    # "She rushes out and practically jogs down the street away from the cafe."
    "Esce di corsa e praticamente si allontana dal bar di corsa lungo la strada."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:173
translate italian lisa12b_7a8a981a:

    # pc "What the heck was that all about?"
    pc "Ma che diavolo è successo?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:176
translate italian lisa12b_859937d5:

    # "I go back to my chair and spend a little while longer getting my homework done for the weekend."
    "Torno alla mia sedia e mi dedico ancora un po’ ai compiti per il fine settimana."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:180
translate italian lisa12b_079a0574:

    # "I ignore her glances and eventually she leaves."
    "Ignoro i suoi sguardi e alla fine se ne va."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:181
translate italian lisa12b_a2180109:

    # "I try to stay focused on my homework and getting everything done for the weekend."
    "Cerco di rimanere concentrato sui compiti e di portare a termine tutto per il fine settimana."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:184
translate italian lisa12b_9c497cad:

    # "When I'm done with everything, I wave goodbye to the barista and leave."
    "Quando ho finito tutto, saluto con la mano il barista e me ne vado."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:189
translate italian lisa12b_9e36c005:

    # "I decide to go to the park and find a nice place to sit, take in the fresh air, and read the assigned book for Mrs. McGee's class."
    "Decido di andare al parco e trovare un bel posticino dove sedermi, respirare aria fresca e leggere il libro assegnato per la lezione della signora McGee."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:190
translate italian lisa12b_2842031e:

    # "It's pretty nice to have a moment to myself where I can just chill and relax and think about things."
    "È davvero bello avere un momento tutto per me in cui posso semplicemente rilassarmi e pensare alle cose."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:193
translate italian lisa12b_960c619f:

    # "The view is very nice as well."
    "Anche la vista è molto bella."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:194
translate italian lisa12b_ce298773:

    # "One of the joggers eyes me as she passes and smiles. I wonder for a moment if I could have a shot with her."
    "Una delle jogger mi lancia un'occhiata mentre mi passa accanto e mi sorride. Per un attimo mi chiedo se potrei avere una possibilità con lei."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:195
translate italian lisa12b_42e64b9f:

    # "But she doesn't stop, and eventually rounds the corner out of sight and I don't see her again."
    "Ma lei non si ferma, alla fine gira l’angolo e scompare dalla mia vista, e non la rivedo più."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:198
translate italian lisa12b_dcbcf27b:

    # "Over the next couple hours, I finish the book Mrs. McGee had assigned."
    "Nelle due ore successive finisco il libro che la signora McGee ci aveva assegnato."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:199
translate italian lisa12b_7b20fab9:

    # "It was actually pretty good too. I'm sort of looking forward to talking about it in class."
    "In realtà era anche piuttosto bello. Non vedo l’ora di parlarne in classe."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:204
translate italian lisa12b_41b3403c:

    # "I decide to go to the Whiterock library and try to get some of my homework done."
    "Decido di andare alla biblioteca di Whiterock e provare a sbrigare un po’ dei miei compiti."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:205
translate italian lisa12b_7307d89e:

    # "The place is quiet and mostly empty, so I look around a bit and find a table in the back that looks like a nice spot to set up."
    "Il posto è tranquillo e quasi vuoto, quindi mi guardo un po’ intorno e trovo un tavolo in fondo che sembra un bel posto dove sistemarmi."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:208
translate italian lisa12b_72ec4c37:

    # "I spend the next hour or so really focusing on getting all my homework finished."
    "Passo l’ora successiva concentrandomi davvero sul portare a termine tutti i miei compiti."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:209
translate italian lisa12b_949c0b25:

    # "I figure that Lisa and I will be busy all evening, so this is the only time I'll have to get it all done."
    "Immagino che io e Lisa saremo impegnate tutta la serata, quindi questo è l’unico momento che avrò per finire tutto."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:210
translate italian lisa12b_d245f0db:

    # "I'm able to get quite a bit done in a short amount of time."
    "Riesco a sbrigare parecchie cose in poco tempo."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:214
translate italian lisa12b_1dfd4fe9:

    # "Then I hear a voice and see a familiar face."
    "Poi sento una voce e vedo un volto familiare."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:215
translate italian lisa12b_9791854f:

    # "Pink-Haired Girl" "Hey you're that guy that was at Nora's election party, right?"
    "Pink-Haired Girl" "Ehi, tu sei quel ragazzo che era alla festa per l’elezione di Nora, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:216
translate italian lisa12b_cc77ea9a:

    # pc "Oh, hey! Yeah, I remember you."
    pc "Oh, ciao! Sì, mi ricordo di te."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:217
translate italian lisa12b_5d1d19bf:

    # "Pink-Haired Girl" "Yeah, man, I remember you too. My name is Rose, by the way."
    "Pink-Haired Girl" "Sì, amico, mi ricordo anch’io di te. A proposito, mi chiamo Rose."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:218
translate italian lisa12b_77b5fda2:

    # pc "Hey Rose. I'm [pcname]."
    pc "Ciao Rose. Io sono [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:219
translate italian lisa12b_7d49340c:

    # pc "You just hanging around the library too?"
    pc "Anche tu stai bighellonando in biblioteca?"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:220
translate italian lisa12b_72c346ac:

    # "Rose" "Nah, man, I work here!"
    "Rose" "No, amico, io lavoro qui!"

# game/Scenes/Lisa/lisa12.rpy:223
translate italian lisa12b_1c6ad685:

